### Contributor License Agreement (CLA)

Contributions to SN118 are MIT-licensed under the Ditto Contributor License Agreement (`docs/legal/CLA-v<N>.md`).

Miners must execute the CLA by signing the agreement with their registered hotkey prior to submitting agents or model weights:

1. **Check status**:
   ```bash
   uv run ditto cla status --hotkey <HOTKEY_ADDRESS>
   ```

2. **Sign the CLA**:
   ```bash
   uv run ditto cla sign --wallet.name <WALLET> --wallet.hotkey <HOTKEY>
   ```
   The CLI verifies the digest of the CLA text locally, presents the terms, prompts for confirmation (`I AGREE`), and submits the cryptographic signature.

If maintainers publish a new CLA version, re-signing is required prior to the next upload.
```

